	(text "Populate R3 _or_ R4, not both!\nR3: Forces PWM mode; consistent 2.2MHz switching. \n    Noisier, but consistently so. VHF squelch may be\n    quieter.\nR4: Auto mode; switches to PFM (bursts, 50 KHz) under\n    10~15% load (60~90mA). Expected that this board \n    will live in that boundary, possibly resulting in \n    frequent PWM <-> PFM transitions. Bench testing \n    required.\nDecide and hard wire for final production."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 227.838 17.526 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8f914b6-452c-488e-b946-1a45f02578ef")
	)
